1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,637
Blob and his two neighbours

2
00:00:01,677 --> 00:00:03,626
lose everything overnight.

3
00:00:03,666 --> 00:00:05,590
Money, houses, fields.

4
00:00:05,630 --> 00:00:06,515
All gone.

5
00:00:06,555 --> 00:00:07,992
Three hungry days later,

6
00:00:08,032 --> 00:00:09,981
each of them gets one chicken.

7
00:00:10,021 --> 00:00:11,258
The first neighbour cooks his

8
00:00:11,298 --> 00:00:12,396
right away.

9
00:00:12,436 --> 00:00:13,960
Best dinner in days.

10
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,311
Also his last.

11
00:00:15,351 --> 00:00:17,013
The second neighbour gets a hen

12
00:00:17,053 --> 00:00:19,215
and eats one egg every morning.

13
00:00:19,255 --> 00:00:20,779
Blob gets a rooster.

14
00:00:20,819 --> 00:00:22,130
No eggs at all.

15
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:23,407
So he knocks on her door

16
00:00:23,447 --> 00:00:24,545
with a deal.

17
00:00:24,585 --> 00:00:26,234
Let my rooster meet your hen,

18
00:00:26,274 --> 00:00:27,798
and I'll share the eggs.

19
00:00:27,838 --> 00:00:29,149
She wanted eggs.

20
00:00:29,189 --> 00:00:30,500
Blob wanted chicks.

21
00:00:30,540 --> 00:00:31,551
Three weeks later,

22
00:00:31,591 --> 00:00:32,903
the first chicks hatch.

23
00:00:32,943 --> 00:00:34,592
About five months after that,

24
00:00:34,632 --> 00:00:36,156
they're laying eggs too.

25
00:00:36,196 --> 00:00:37,432
Blob's yard fills up so fast

26
00:00:37,472 --> 00:00:38,483
he can't keep up,

27
00:00:38,523 --> 00:00:40,186
so he hires the first neighbour

28
00:00:40,226 --> 00:00:41,749
and pays him in eggs.

29
00:00:41,789 --> 00:00:42,675
Same start.

30
00:00:42,715 --> 00:00:43,813
Same chicken.

31
00:00:43,853 --> 00:00:44,864
Now one is poor,

32
00:00:44,904 --> 00:00:46,341
one is comfortable,

33
00:00:46,381 --> 00:00:47,692
and one is rich.

34
00:00:47,732 --> 00:00:48,969
Subscribe so you don't miss

35
00:00:49,009 --> 00:00:50,460
Blob's next lesson.
